# Unkeyed: mentor holds row indices and row 2 stores 9, past the end of the world. That is an
# exact nonnegative index — carrier-valid, never resolvable — so it is a dead link and not
# malformed storage, and the gather that reads it must be bounded rather than faulting.
n 4
rel mentor -1 0 9 1
col nord bool 1 1 1 1
col dead bool 1 0 0 0
col gold num 0 0 0 0
